// The app nav can be either expanded or collapsed
// by default it is expanded
// on page refresh the app nav checks for 'neon-app-nav-is-expanded' in local storage
// if false it renders it collapsed
// This exported util is used BEFORE the app-nav is mounted and connected to allow for skeleton state consistency across manual refreshes/navigation

